From: Cartouche Wine
Subject: [PATCH] loader: Cartouche bundle identity and Game Mode keys.

Applies to sources/wine of crossover-sources-26.3.0.tar.gz (SHA-256
ac99c8ca4b3848f3e81784135f023df266b61c2345726ea55a50b3e030dd6872, Wine 11.0).

The wine loader embeds loader/wine_info.plist in its __TEXT,__info_plist
section. CodeWeavers' copy (CrossOver Hack 10913) names it
com.codeweavers.CrossOver.wineloader / "CrossOver-Hosted Application", so
the macOS application menu of every game reads "Quit CrossOver-Hosted
Application". Cartouche Wine is not CrossOver.

- CFBundleIdentifier dev.bryann2k.cartouche.wineloader, CFBundleName
  "Cartouche Wine" (the menu reads "Quit Cartouche Wine").
- LSApplicationCategoryType public.app-category.games, LSSupportsGameMode
  (macOS 26+) and GCSupportsGameMode (macOS 14+). They make the process
  eligible for Game Mode; macOS decides, in full screen only, so it is not
  guaranteed to start.
  https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/information-property-list/lssupportsgamemode

A new bundle identifier may make macOS ask again for permissions it had
granted to the old one (not verified).

---
--- a/loader/wine_info.plist.in
+++ b/loader/wine_info.plist.in
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 <?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
 <!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
+<!-- Modified by Cartouche Wine on 2026-10-30: bundle identifier, name, Game Mode keys. -->
 <plist version="1.0">
 <dict>
     <key>CFBundleAllowMixedLocalizations</key>
@@ -9,11 +10,11 @@
     <key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
     <string>wineloader</string><!-- CrossOver Hack 10913 -->
     <key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
-    <string>com.codeweavers.CrossOver.wineloader</string><!-- CrossOver Hack 10913 -->
+    <string>dev.bryann2k.cartouche.wineloader</string><!-- CrossOver Hack 10913, Cartouche Wine -->
     <key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
     <string>6.0</string>
     <key>CFBundleName</key>
-    <string>CrossOver-Hosted Application</string><!-- CrossOver Hack 10913 -->
+    <string>Cartouche Wine</string><!-- CrossOver Hack 10913, Cartouche Wine -->
     <key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
     <string>APPL</string>
     <key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
@@ -26,5 +27,12 @@
     <string>WineApplication</string>
     <key>LSUIElement</key>
     <string>1</string>
+    <!-- Game Mode eligibility; macOS still decides, in full screen only -->
+    <key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key>
+    <string>public.app-category.games</string>
+    <key>LSSupportsGameMode</key>
+    <true/>
+    <key>GCSupportsGameMode</key>
+    <true/>
 </dict>
 </plist>
